{"id":"sh/ml07i9sv","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 4","position":{"left":89.28,"top":194.88,"width":1100.16,"height":185.28},"text":"屋外の位置情報と近距離探索を、ひとつのアプリで使い分ける。\n位置が古い、受信できない、充電が必要という状態も分かるようにする。\n\n差別化の仮説：SLASによる精度改善で、捜索範囲や発見までの時間を減らす。\n同じ受信機で補正の有無を比較し、価格に見合う効果があるか検証する。","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/7m98ru9g","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 5","position":{"left":72,"top":422.4,"width":1134.72,"height":148.8},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#FFFDF0","lineColor":"#E8D750","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/oryp8fah","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 6","position":{"left":89.28,"top":433.92,"width":316.8,"height":26.88},"text":"一番強い特徴","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/pc76hkr2","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":89.28,"top":468.48,"width":1100.16,"height":89.28},"text":"「どこを探すか」を決めやすくする、猫向けの捜索支援。\n優位性は測位誤差だけでなく、模擬捜索の所要時間で確かめる。","style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#0557FF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
